{
  "name": "devd design system",
  "version": "0.25.6",
  "direction": [
    "dark only",
    "graphite surfaces",
    "one blue for the primary action, location and live state",
    "status colour only beside a word or an icon",
    "hairlines and space instead of nested boxes",
    "restrained 120-220ms motion, removed under prefers-reduced-motion"
  ],
  "tokens": {
    "colour": {
      "primary": "--color-primary",
      "primary-content": "--color-primary-content",
      "secondary": "--color-secondary",
      "secondary-content": "--color-secondary-content",
      "accent": "--color-accent",
      "accent-content": "--color-accent-content",
      "neutral": "--color-neutral",
      "neutral-content": "--color-neutral-content",
      "base-100": "--color-base-100",
      "base-200": "--color-base-200",
      "base-300": "--color-base-300",
      "base-content": "--color-base-content",
      "info": "--color-info",
      "info-content": "--color-info-content",
      "success": "--color-success",
      "success-content": "--color-success-content",
      "warning": "--color-warning",
      "warning-content": "--color-warning-content",
      "error": "--color-error",
      "error-content": "--color-error-content"
    },
    "shape": {
      "radius-selector": "6px",
      "radius-field": "8px",
      "radius-box": "12px",
      "size-selector": "14px",
      "size-field": "28px",
      "border": "1px",
      "depth": "0",
      "noise": "0"
    },
    "type": {
      "2xs": "11px",
      "xs": "12px",
      "sm": "13px",
      "md": "14px",
      "lg": "16px",
      "xl": "18px",
      "2xl": "22px",
      "display": "28px"
    },
    "space": { "s1": "4px", "s2": "8px", "s3": "12px", "s4": "16px", "s5": "24px", "s6": "32px", "s7": "48px" },
    "motion": { "fast": "120ms", "base": "180ms", "slow": "220ms" }
  },
  "agent_output": {
    "format": "markdown",
    "allowed_blocks": ["heading", "paragraph", "ordered-list", "unordered-list", "table", "fenced-code", "chart", "metrics", "steps", "timeline", "details", "mermaid", "math", "blockquote", "horizontal-rule"],
    "allowed_inline": ["strong", "emphasis", "inline-code", "link-http-https"],
    "notes": [
      "Every block is sanitised and rendered by the application's md() renderer with the shared classes.",
      "Use a fenced code block with the language name for code; long blocks fold automatically.",
      "Use a Markdown table for structured results; it becomes the shared table with numeric alignment.",
      "A ```chart fence holds JSON {title, subtitle?, unit?, bars:[{label, note?, value, color?|tone?}], takeaway?, source?}. It is validated and drawn as the shared bar chart; at most 12 bars.",
      "```metrics {items:[{label, value, unit?, delta?, detail?, color?}], lower_is_better?}, ```steps {title?, items, current}, ```timeline {items:[{at?, text, detail?, tone?}]} and ```details {title, hint?, body} are drawn the same way; data that does not validate stays a code block.",
      "A colour is red, orange, yellow, green, teal, blue, violet or pink, or a tone (success, warning, error, info). Give it a meaning and say the same in words.",
      "State a status in words as well as a tag: 'failed', 'passed', 'waiting for you'.",
      "Never produce a raw URL image; attach a file through the upload/reference mechanism instead."
    ],
    "forbidden": [
      "raw HTML of any kind",
      "script, style, iframe, object, embed, form or input elements",
      "inline event handlers such as onclick",
      "javascript: or data: URLs",
      "external stylesheets, fonts or widgets",
      "arbitrary CSS, CSS variables or positioning",
      "canvas, WebGL or video elements"
    ]
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "markdown",
      "surface": "conversation",
      "agent": true,
      "description": "The one rich-content renderer.",
      "elements": ["headings", "paragraphs", "lists", "tables", "blockquotes", "inline code", "links", "fenced code", "horizontal rule"],
      "classes": ["md"]
    },
    {
      "id": "code-block",
      "surface": "conversation",
      "agent": true,
      "description": "A fenced code block; long blocks fold behind Expand.",
      "classes": ["md-code", "log-block"],
      "states": ["default", "folded", "expanded"]
    },
    {
      "id": "table",
      "surface": "conversation",
      "agent": true,
      "description": "A Markdown table. The first row is the head; numeric cells align end.",
      "classes": ["md-table", "table"],
      "props": ["columns", "align"]
    },
    {
      "id": "chart",
      "surface": "conversation",
      "agent": true,
      "description": "A bar chart from a ```chart JSON block: a title, labelled bars with notes, the value in the colour of its bar, and a takeaway. Validated to labels, finite non-negative values and at most 12 bars.",
      "classes": ["viz", "viz-bars", "viz-bar-row", "viz-bar-fill", "viz-bar-value", "viz-foot"],
      "schema": { "title": "string?", "subtitle": "string?", "unit": "string?", "max": "number?", "color": "palette?", "bars": "[{label:string, note?:string, value:number, color?:palette, tone?:success|warning|error}]", "takeaway": "string?", "source": "string?" }
    },
    {
      "id": "metrics",
      "surface": "conversation",
      "agent": true,
      "description": "Headline numbers in one strip, each with a label, an optional delta and a detail line.",
      "classes": ["viz", "viz-metrics", "viz-metric", "viz-delta"],
      "schema": { "title": "string?", "items": "[{label:string, value:number|string, unit?:string, delta?:string, detail?:string, color?:palette}]", "lower_is_better": "boolean?" }
    },
    {
      "id": "callout",
      "surface": "app",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "A tinted line with a tone icon and a word. Agent prose uses a blockquote instead.",
      "classes": ["notice", "notice-ok", "notice-warn", "notice-bad", "notice-info"],
      "props": ["tone", "title", "body"]
    },
    {
      "id": "status",
      "surface": "app",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "A dot and a word. Never a colour alone.",
      "classes": ["dot", "dot-ok", "dot-warn", "dot-bad", "dot-live", "dot-off", "pill"],
      "props": ["tone", "label"]
    },
    {
      "id": "button",
      "surface": "app",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "One control vocabulary.",
      "classes": ["btn", "btn-primary", "btn-go", "btn-ghost", "btn-danger", "btn-mini", "btn-icon"],
      "states": ["hover", "focus-visible", "pressed", "disabled", "loading"]
    },
    {
      "id": "field",
      "surface": "app",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "A label, a control and an optional hint or error.",
      "classes": ["field", "field-label", "input", "select", "textarea", "ds-validator"],
      "states": ["default", "focus", "invalid", "disabled", "read-only"]
    },
    {
      "id": "choice",
      "surface": "app",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "Checkbox, radio, toggle and range on one token set.",
      "classes": ["ds-check", "ds-radio", "ds-toggle", "ds-range"],
      "states": ["default", "checked", "indeterminate", "disabled", "focus-visible"]
    },
    {
      "id": "progress",
      "surface": "app",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "Determinate work; a share bar for proportions.",
      "classes": ["ds-progress", "ds-radial", "share"],
      "props": ["value", "max", "tone"]
    },
    {
      "id": "steps",
      "surface": "conversation",
      "agent": true,
      "description": "A short ordered process with a current step, from a ```steps JSON block.",
      "classes": ["viz-steps", "viz-step", "viz-step-node"],
      "props": ["steps", "current"]
    },
    {
      "id": "timeline",
      "surface": "app",
      "agent": true,
      "description": "Recorded events in order. In a conversation, from a ```timeline JSON block (viz-tl); in the app, the run feed.",
      "classes": ["timeline", "tl-item", "run-event", "viz-tl", "viz-tl-item"],
      "props": ["items"]
    },
    {
      "id": "collapse",
      "surface": "app",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "One arrow language for every folded section.",
      "classes": ["ui-fold", "run-fold", "worked"],
      "states": ["closed", "open"]
    },
    {
      "id": "drawer",
      "surface": "app",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "A right-side detail sheet; Escape closes it and focus returns.",
      "classes": ["drawer", "drawer-head", "drawer-body"]
    },
    {
      "id": "modal",
      "surface": "app",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "A decision, with a cancel and one confirm.",
      "classes": ["modal", "modal-head", "modal-body", "modal-foot"],
      "states": ["default", "danger", "busy"]
    },
    {
      "id": "conversation",
      "surface": "conversation",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "One turn with who, body, actions and a worked fold.",
      "classes": ["turn", "turn-who", "turn-body", "worked", "team-note", "chat-plan"],
      "states": ["streaming", "complete", "stopped", "error"]
    },
    {
      "id": "diff",
      "surface": "conversation",
      "agent": false,
      "description": "A real patch, counted by code, tests and docs.",
      "classes": ["diff", "diff-line", "diff-add", "diff-del", "diff-badge"],
      "states": ["added", "removed", "context", "folded"]
    }
  ],
  "excluded": [
    "aura", "carousel", "countdown", "fab", "hero", "hover-3d", "hover-gallery",
    "mask", "megamenu", "mockup-phone", "mockup-window", "otp", "rating", "swap",
    "text-rotate", "theme-controller"
  ]
}
